Subject: [datatable-help] calculating lagged values of panel data using
 data.table
In-Reply-To: <CAM0q7u0tUS0ObfmYCZP=DmB_g-w8v1qk8Wb_h9xxTzyyRfXp2w@mail.gmail.com>
